  "behavior": [
    "BrowserSdkClient.close(options) requires a 1\u201360000ms deadline and returns Promise<void>, matching the frozen TypeScript signature. Invalid options refuse before retirement. Valid options retire immediately, including a pre-aborted signal.",
    "One caller budget bounds the join. Deadline/abort ends only that wait; cleanup continues and a later close joins the same owners. No durable cancellation/end/replacement intent is submitted.",
    "Control ownership joins terminal transport closure, the reader pump, admitted/signing/write work, stream cancellation and abort, then releases stream locks. Late physical-stream opening is fenced and cancelled/aborted. Reconnect tracks opening and retired physicals; at most16unsettled physicals may be retained before refusing further allocation.",
    "Native media joins receive/drain/reconciliation, datagram cancellation/abort and audio capture/renderer cleanup. RTC joins signaling work, uncertain track replacement and renderer cleanup. Current capture/render startup wrappers are tracked; retired local readiness/control promises settle before successful shutdown. Cleanup failures remain observed and are reported after owned work settles.",
    "Application reads abort active wrappers, join owned HTTP fetch/body cancellation and release body reader locks. Application resolvers/device prompts are fenced without waiting indefinitely for uncooperative application work; late tracks stop and late profiles cannot create another physical."
  ],
